/-
  The public API of the free-group family: free generators of finite-index subgroups of
  `SL(2, ℤ)` modulo `-1`.

  Four `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup` headlines over the Kurosh engine:

  * `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.nonempty_freeGroupBasis_map_quotient_center_of_forall_trace_ne`
    — `Γ` modulo the centre has a free basis of rank `1 + Γ.index / 6`;
  * `…exists_generators_free_mod_neg_one_of_forall_trace_ne` — `Γ` is generated by `-1` and
    `1 + Γ.index / 6` further elements, freely modulo `-1`;
  * `…finrank_addMonoidHom_eq_of_forall_trace_ne` — the `ℚ`-dimension of `Additive Γ →+ K`
    is `1 + Γ.index / 6`;
  * `…exists_addMonoidHom_conj_T_pow_minimalPeriod_eq_of_finsum_eq_zero` — the edge-chain
    engine's headline.

  This module exists for the **user**: the checker needs no façade (`spec-pin:` is per module),
  so the split is a discovery decision, not a wire one — the engine is
  `GroupTheory/FreeGroup/KuroshRank.lean`, and a user looking for the `SL₂` generation API
  imports a module named for it.

  Transcribed whole from the four `Theorems/` wrappers and their `S_` files (pinned `aa2d8b3`,
  686 pin lines); the declarations are under the wrappers' mathlib namespaces
  (`Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.*`). Assumes the Kurosh engine and the Bass–Serre/ping-pong
  modules.

  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_nonempty_freeGroupBasis_map_quotient_center_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_nonempty_freeGroupBasis_map_quotient_center_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_exists_generators_free_mod_neg_one_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_exists_generators_free_mod_neg_one_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_finrank_addMonoidHom_eq_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_Matrix_SpecialLinearGroup_finrank_addMonoidHom_eq_of_forall_trace_ne.lean
